<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>第二阶段全过程：九个环节与一条依赖链</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C9DCF7', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>03 第二阶段 · 过程</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 88, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F0F5FC', paddingLeft: 15, paddingRight: 15, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>一条主线：进化只负责在空中搜「归属 × 顺序」，其余交给解码端的确定性程序。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 15, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center'}}><Box style={{width: 1120, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 4}}><Box style={{width: 200, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>输入</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>S + 机队 + DEM</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>已选任务集、参与机状态、三维代价接口</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 17, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 200, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>①</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>参与机选择</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>K ≤ N−1；demand 贪心最大覆盖 + 服务能力补机</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 17, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 200, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>②</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>统一编码</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>起始基因 + 巡游基因；cost_vector 连续代价指纹</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 17, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 200, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>③</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>DMDE 差分</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>CR(g) / F / 温度退火 / GMR 灭绝 / penalty 比较</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 17, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 200, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>④</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>逆映射四步</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>首任务匹配 → 巡游边匹配 → 扰动 → 段规范化</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 15, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center'}}><Box style={{width: 1120, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 4}}><Box style={{width: 200, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>⑤</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>解码修复链</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>≤6 轮不动点；内层反复调用终点巢 MCF</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 17, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 200, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>⑥</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>分层评价 f</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>覆盖门禁口径下的单一加权标量</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 17, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 200, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>⑦</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>回写通道（默认关）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>纯 Baldwin；repair_replacement 可开</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 17, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 200, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>⑧</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>交付后 polish</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>跨机改派 + 2-opt / Or-opt；四道门只接受严格改进</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 17, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 200, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>交付</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>航次 + 诊断量</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>任务序列、终点机巢、适应度与门禁统计</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 13, gap: 8}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>注意顺序：终点机巢最小费用流是修复链的内层子问题（在 ⑤ 内被反复调用），不是链条末尾的独立一步。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>分工：可行性 → 修复链；终点巢 → 最小费用流；成本余量 → polish；评价 → f；回写为可选对照通道（默认关）。编码维度因此得以保持最紧的 N，每个环节都能单独验证、单独替换。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 进展汇报（合并版）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>20 / 29</Text></Box></Slide>